# CODEOWNERS — copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and adapt.
# Syntax: <path-pattern>  <owner> [<owner>...]   (last matching rule wins)
# Owners are @user, @org/team, or email. Prefer TEAMS over individuals so
# ownership survives PTO/offboarding. Keep a catch-all so nothing is unowned.

# Catch-all — every path has at least this owner (REQUIRED; the kit warns if absent).
*                       @your-org/core

# Examples — route sensitive areas to accountable teams:
# /.github/             @your-org/platform
# /infra/  *.tf         @your-org/infra
# /auth/                @your-org/security
# *.py                  @your-org/backend
# /frontend/            @your-org/frontend
